{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\" event:schema='{\"type\": \"object\"}'>\n    <onentry>\n      <event:schema/>\n      <event:defer/>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\" event:schma=\"true\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":4,"notes":0,"total":4,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":34,"byteOffset":204,"endColumn":53,"endLine":4,"startColumn":19,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `event:schema`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":53,"endLine":4,"startColumn":20,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`event:schema` is not allowed on `<state>`\n\n**Note:** the `event` vocabulary describes event data only on `<transition>`, `<send>`, `<raise>`, or `<donedata>`: the `_event.data` a transition handles, the data a `<send>` or `<raise>` creates its event with, or the data of the `done.state.<id>` event of a `<donedata>`\n\n**Help:** move the attribute to `<transition>`, `<send>`, `<raise>`, or `<donedata>`, or remove it","text":"`event:schema` is not allowed on `<state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":238,"start":205},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":20,"endLine":6,"startColumn":8,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<event:schema>` is not an element of the `event` vocabulary\n\n**Note:** `https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event` has one element, `<event:defer/>` in a transition's content, which holds the event the transition handles; `event:schema` or `event:schemaexpr` on `<transition>`, `<send>`, `<raise>`, or `<donedata>` describes the event data the element handles or creates\n\n**Help:** remove the element, and describe the event data with an `event:schema` attribute on the element that handles or creates it","text":"`<event:schema>` is not an element of the `event` vocabulary"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":273,"start":261},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":19,"endLine":7,"startColumn":8,"startLine":7}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<event:defer>` is only allowed in the content of a `<transition>` with an `event` attribute\n\n**Note:** `<event:defer/>` holds the event the transition handles until the transition's state is exited or a state inside it that handles the event is entered; it is executable content of a `<transition event>` (directly or inside its `<if>` and `<foreach>`) only\n\n**Help:** move it into the transition that handles the event to hold, or remove it","text":"`<event:defer>` is only allowed in the content of a `<transition>` with an `event` attribute"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":294,"start":283},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":362,"endColumn":56,"endLine":9,"startColumn":51,"startLine":9},"insertedContent":{"text":"schema"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `schema`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":63,"endLine":9,"startColumn":45,"startLine":9}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`event:schma` is not an attribute of the `event` vocabulary\n\n**Note:** the `event` vocabulary has exactly two attributes: `event:schema` (a JSON Schema, inline or by reference) and `event:schemaexpr` (an expression whose value is the schema)\n\n**Help:** did you mean `schema`?","text":"`event:schma` is not an attribute of the `event` vocabulary"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":374,"start":356},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event` is the host's vocabulary for events: `event:schema` and `event:schemaexpr` on `<transition>` (the `_event.data` it handles), `<send>` and `<raise>` (the data their event is created with), and `<donedata>` (the data of the `done.state.<id>` event), and the empty `<event:defer/>` in the content of a `<transition>` with an `event` attribute (it holds the event the transition handles). It has no other elements or attributes, and they mean nothing anywhere else. The W3C schema admits attributes and elements in other namespaces laxly, so only this rule catches a misplaced or misspelled one"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the attribute to the element whose event data it describes, or `<event:defer/>` into the transition whose event it holds, correct the name, or remove it.\n\nRun `scx --explain EVENT001` for examples."},"id":"EVENT001","name":"EVENT001","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the `event` namespace is used outside the attributes of an element with event data or a transition's `<event:defer/>`"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}